{"text": "Haverford & Stellan, Attorneys at Law\n9300 Wickham Parkway, Suite 410, Columbus, Ohio 43240\nToll-free (866) 555-0147 - Fax 614-555-0190 - Hours Mon-Thu 8 a.m. to 8 p.m., Fri 8-5 ET - www.haverfordstellan.example/pay\nApril 14, 2026\nDeshawn R. Oduya\n1127 Sycamore Run Drive, Apt. 6C\nDayton, OH 45417\nOur file: HS-2026-044871\nCurrent creditor: Corvid Receivables Fund IV, LLC\nOriginal creditor: Marigold Bank, N.A.\nAccount: Marigold Rewards Mastercard XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-5339\nTotal due as of April 14, 2026: $6,418.27\nDear Mr. Oduya:\nHaverford & Stellan is a debt collector. We are trying to collect a debt that you owe to Corvid Receivables Fund IV, LLC (\"Corvid\"). We will use any information you give us to help collect the debt. At this time no attorney with this firm has personally reviewed the particular circumstances of your account.\nHow much you owe\nAs of September 30, 2024, you owed:\t$5,302.66\nBetween September 30, 2024 and today, you were charged this amount in interest:\t+ $1,290.61\nBetween September 30, 2024 and today, you were charged this amount in fees:\t+ $75.00\nBetween September 30, 2024 and today, you paid or were credited this amount:\t- $250.00\nTotal amount of the debt now:\t$6,418.27\n\nOur records show the card was opened in 06/2019 in the name DESHAWN ROMELL ODUYA. The last payment before charge-off, $125.00, was received on July 8, 2024. Marigold charged the account off and sold it to Corvid on 11/21/2024 (Corvid reference CRF4-00918827-M). To protect your privacy we show only part of the card number; the full sixteen digits begin 4118 04.\nYour rights\nYou have until May 19, 2026 to dispute all or part of the debt. If you write to us by then to dispute it, we must stop collection on the amount you dispute until we send you information that shows you owe it (15 U.S.C. § 1692g; Regulation F, 12 CFR § 1006.34). You may use the form at the bottom of this letter or write to us without it. You may also write to ask for the name and address of the original creditor, if different from the current creditor. We are licensed where Ohio law requires it (ORC § 1319.12).\nWhat else you can do\nGo to the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau's website for more information about your rights. Contact us about your payment options. Se habla español: (866) 555-0152.\nOffer\nIf you cannot pay the total now, either of these will resolve the account. Option A: one payment of $3,850.00 received by May 29, 2026. Option B: 24 monthly payments of $275.00 starting 06/05/26. Pay online at https://pay.haverfordstellan.example/a/HS-2026-044871 with PIN 77302, or call 866-555-0147 ext. 3306 and ask for Marisela Papazian. To confirm your identity Ms. Papazian will ask for your date of birth (we have 08/30/1991) and the last four digits of your Social Security number (we have xxx-xx-4556).\nOur file lists Gantry Row Pallet Works, Inc. as your employer. We have not contacted your employer. Our records also show a Chapter 13 case dismissed in 2023 (S.D. Ohio No. 3:22-bk-31187). If you are now in bankruptcy, this letter is for information only and is not a demand for payment.\nSincerely,\nIngrid Stellan, Attorney at Law (Ohio Sup. Ct. Reg. No. 0088214)\nistellan@haverfordstellan.example\nThis communication is from a debt collector.\n\nDetach and return. Mail to P.O. Box 18077, Columbus, OH 43218-0077.\nName: Oduya, Deshawn R. - File: HS-2026-044871 - D. Oduya signature: __________\n• I dispute this debt because I think: __________\n• I enclose this amount: $________. Make checks payable to Haverford & Stellan Client Trust Account.", "kind": "Rich Text document", "detail": "592 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Deshawn R. Oduya", "DESHAWN ROMELL ODUYA", "Marigold", "Ingrid Stellan", "Marisela Papazian", "Oduya", "Deshawn R."], "companies": ["Haverford & Stellan", "Corvid Receivables Fund IV, LLC", "Marigold Bank, N.A.", "Haverford Stellan", "Corvid", "Gantry Row Pallet Works, Inc.", "Haverford & Stellan Client Trust